Short: powerful file system for TA with GUI
Uploader: grovesc@deakin.edu.au (Mike Everest)
Author: Mike Everest
Type: comm/bbs
Requires: 2.04+
Version: 3.15 (beta)
Replaces: fm308.lha

Long: A complete file management system for BBS sysops.  Allows easy GUI
move, copy, delete, edit, examination of files and file areas.
Includes file_id.diz and filenote support, allows users to choose files
by number, multiple line descriptions.  Fully configurable with many
options and features.


